        <h1>Sintra, <em>beyond the palaces.</em></h1>
        <p>A town wrapped in mist, gardens that feel like another world, and a mountain full of stories. Here is how to experience it with a little more time and a little less rushing.</p>
        <a class="button button-light" href="#day-plan">Plan your day <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
